+        # ONE pass over the lake serves both halves (Phase 1a of the Rust port, 2026-10-17; this was
+        # two full passes, the guard's `self.replay()` and the pass-through's `_bin.replay()`): a
+        # FACT record is decoded for the guard exactly as `replay()` decodes it (a malformed one is
